This was a "fix build error" commit, meaning the override in StartUpView.java no longer matched the IPlayerClientListener interface's method signature (which had come to expect a Position parameter), causing a compile-time mismatch.

Tracing the exact line/method across the candidates:

- candidate_01: StartUpView.java is created as a bare skeleton with no IPlayerClientListener implementation at all.
